{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":25863558,"ns":0,"title":"Schistura susannae","revisions":[{"revid":1366839490,"parentid":1362812728,"minor":false,"timestamp":"2026-07-30T14:58:12Z","size":1824,"sha1":"e1032481bccc41c33ed4727327d6106ce47dc311","slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","content":"{{Short description|Species of fish}}\n{{Speciesbox\n| status = VU\n| status_system = IUCN3.1\n| status_ref = <ref name=\"iucn status 18 November 2021\">{{cite iucn |author=Huckstorf, V. |author2=Freyhof, J. |date=2011 |title=''Schistura susannae'' |volume=2011 |article-number=e.T187941A8639448 |doi=10.2305/IUCN.UK.2011-1.RLTS.T187941A8639448.en |access-date=18 November 2021}}</ref>\n| taxon = Schistura susannae\n| authority = [[Jörg Freyhof|Freyhof]] & [[Dmitri V. Serov|Serov]], 2001<ref name =FB>{{FishBase | genus = Schistura | species = susannae | month = October | year = 2017}}</ref>\n}}\n\n'''''Schistura susannae''''' is a species of [[ray-finned fish]], a [[Nemacheilidae|stone loach]], in the genus ''[[Schistura]]''. It occurs in small mountain streams which have [[waterfall]]s and small [[riffle]]s, where it is usually observed in pools with gravel or sandy bottoms. It has only been found to occur in the Mong Mo river, a small coastal drainage, in central Vietnam.<ref name=\"iucn status 18 November 2021\" /> The [[Specific name (zoology)|specific name]] honors Susanne Klähr, for the help she gave to [[Maurice Kottelat]] in his field work.<ref name = ETYFish>{{cite web | url = http://www.etyfish.org/loaches3/ | title = Order CYPRINIFORMES: Family NEMACHEILIDAE (Stone Loaches) | access-date = 21 January 2018 | publisher = Christopher Scharpf and Kenneth J. Lazara | work = The ETYFish Project Fish Name Etymology Database | year = 2017 | archive-date = 3 March 2016 | archive-url = https://web.archive.org/web/20160303203430/http://www.etyfish.org/loaches3/ | url-status = dead }}</ref>\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n{{Taxonbar|from=Q3761959}}\n\n[[Category:Schistura|S]]\n[[Category:Fish described in 2001]]\n[[Category:Taxa named by Jörg Freyhof]]\n[[Category:Taxa named by Dmitri V. Serov]]\n\n{{Schistura-stub}}"}}}],"contentmodel":"wikitext","pagelanguage":"en","pagelanguagehtmlcode":"en","pagelanguagedir":"ltr","touched":"2026-10-30T05:14:04Z","lastrevid":1366839490,"length":1824}]}}